        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "I found one inconsistent local test: it expects 2 for `[1, 10]` with `k=1`, but only `10` is beautiful, so the specification’s answer of 1 is correct. I’ll implement the specified behavior with digit DP and check it against brute-force results before publishing.",
